#: ../../webgis-src/chb7_mapserver-wcs/chapter.rst:2
msgid "Use of WCS in MapServer"
msgstr "WCS在MapServer中的使用"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb7_mapserver-wcs/chapter.rst:4
msgid ""
"WFS publishes vector data service on the Web, while for raster data "
"service, OGC formulates WCS (Web Coverage Services, network coverage "
"service). The raster data set obtained through WCS service is called "
"overlay, where the coverage is generally raster data, but also includes "
"TIN and so on. The data returned by the WCS service can be used as input "
"parameters for analysis and modeling operations. This is in sharp "
"contrast to the OGC WMS service, which only returns pictures of the data."
msgstr ""
"WFS在Web上发布矢量数据服务，而对于栅格数据服务，OGC制定了WCS(Web Coverage "
"Services，网络覆盖服务)。通过WCS服务获得的栅格数据集称为覆盖，其中覆盖通常是栅格数据，但也包括TIN等。WCS服务返回的数据可用作分析和建模操作的输入参数。这与OGC"
" WMS服务形成鲜明对比，后者只返回数据的图片。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb7_mapserver-wcs/chapter.rst:13
msgid ""
"There is no built-in support for WCS in the front-end libraries Leaflet "
"and OpenLayers. If you are a service / data provider and the coverage "
"data is two-dimensional, you can consider the WMS that provides the data "
"at the same time. If you are not a service provider and you have only one"
" WCS endpoint to use, you will not be able to write your own code. "
"Similarly, if you have multidimensional coverage and want to provide two-"
"dimensional data, you have to do the same. Examples can be found on the "
"Internet."
msgstr "在前端库、传单和OpenLayers中没有内置的WCS支持。如果您是服务/数据提供商，并且覆盖数据是二维的，则可以考虑同时提供数据的WMS。如果您不是服务提供商，并且只有一个WCS终结点可用，则您将无法编写自己的代码。同样，如果你有多维覆盖并想要提供二维数据，你也必须这样做。这些例子可以在互联网上找到。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb7_mapserver-wcs/sec01_wcs/section.rst:4
msgid "WCS Map Service"
msgstr "WCS地图服务"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb7_mapserver-wcs/sec01_wcs/section.rst:6
msgid ""
"WCS - Web Coverage Service, WCS is a specification for sharing geospatial"
" data in the form of “Coverage” on the Web as defined by the OGC. The so-"
"called “Coverage” refers to data that can return the value of any "
"specified point in its space-time domain, and its form is easy to input "
"into the model for use. The WCS service realizes the sharing of raster "
"image datasets in the form of “Coverage”."
msgstr ""
"WCS-Web Coverage "
"Service，WCS是一种规范，用于在OGC定义的Web上以“Coverage”的形式共享地理空间数据。所谓覆盖范围，是指能够返回其时空域中任意指定点的值，其形式便于输入模型使用的数据。WCS服务以Coverage的形式实现了栅格影像数据集的共享。"

